# Generated by `pnpm --filter @gymmap/server openapi:emit`, which deep-key-sorts the document
# and writes `JSON.stringify(doc, null, 2)` precisely so two emissions are byte-identical.
# `openapi-drift.int-spec.ts` diffs the committed file against a fresh emission, so Prettier
# reformatting it makes the two disagree permanently: emit writes one shape, `pnpm format`
# rewrites it, and the drift check fails on a file nobody edited. Two tools cannot both own one
# file's bytes — the same reason tokens.css and _inventory.generated.ts are listed above.
openapi.json
